<title>SINGAPORE: Low offer in Bangladesh jet tender from Glencore.</title>
<headline>Low offer in Bangladesh jet tender from Glencore.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The best offer in Bangladesh Petroleum Corp's (BPC) tender to buy 155,000 barrels of jet fuel was made by Swiss trader Glencore at $1.48 per barrel above Singapore spot quotes, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The cargo is for April 22-24 delivery cost-and-freight Chittagong.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
</text>
